Error [E1102]: `cfg` can't cross into a task because `Config` isn't sendable
  --> tests/ui/unsendable_struct.jet:11:32
    |
 11 |     t :: tasks.spawn(take(cfg) () => cfg.id)
    |                                ^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `Config` contains `logger`, which holds a `ref` field at `logger.sink`; tasks and channels move owned values between threads
 Fix: give the task plain owned data, or remove the shared-view field before spawning
